YARA catalogs (catalogs/yara/).

modules.toml, generated by scripts/sync_yara_modules.py, combines two sources:

- the module declarations of libyara 4.5.4 (VirusTotal/yara,
  libyara/modules/*/*.c, the begin_declarations blocks): member names, kinds
  and function signatures. Copyright (c) 2007-2016 The YARA Authors, BSD
  3-Clause License (LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause-libyara.txt);
- the module reflection of YARA-X 1.23.0 (VirusTotal/yara-x, the yara-x
  crate's `mods::reflect`, read by scripts/yara-modules): member names,
  types, function signatures and documentation. Copyright (c) 2024 The
  YARA-X Authors, BSD 3-Clause License (LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause-YARA-X.txt).

Names, types and signatures are reformatted; documentation strings are
copied as YARA-X publishes them.

language.toml is written for this repository from the opentide YARA
language spec (yara-1.0) and the HarfangLab and Bitdefender platform specs.
